lf-life (embedded in bone matrix). (5) **Reassess with DEXA and bone turnover markers** periodically; resume if BMD declines or fracture occurs. (Ref: ASBMR Task Force 2016; Hazzard''s Ch. 77; ACP Clinical Guidelines)'),
